rt"},"level":"1","description2":{"zh":"以气御力。使一名友方单位在短时间内拥有可用真气抵挡部分伤害的能力。","en":"Control force with Qi. Grant an ally the ability to absorb partial damage using Qi for a short time."},"ap":"2"},{"id":"1002400","name":{"zh":"长虹贯日","en":"Rainbow Piercer"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"快速舞动长枪，将枪气汇聚一点，朝远处的敌人冲去并造成击退效果，获得一层枪意状态。","en":"Rapidly spin the spear, focusing spear qi into a single point, then charge toward distant enemies to inflict knockback and gain 1 stack of Spear Intent status."},"ap":"4","mp":"800"},{"id":"1000700","name":{"zh":"飞燕追月","en":"Swallow Chases Moon"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"长剑绝学之一，以不可琢磨的身法连斩敌人，使用后有四成概率闪避下一次攻击。","en":"A sword art that repeatedly slashes enemies with unpredictable footwork. Upon use, grants a 40% chance to evade the next attack."},"ap":"4","mp":"1100"}],"debateCards":[],"warSouls":[{"id":"S1000402","name":{"zh":"恢复[极]","en":"Recovery [Supreme]"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"部队在非交战状态时, 每秒恢复3%的伤兵","en":"When not in combat, recovers 3% of wounded troops per second"}},{"id":"S1002305","name":{"zh":"固防","en":"Solid Defense"},"level":"0","description2":{"zh":"防御提高10%","en":"Defense increased by 10%"}}],"battleSouls":[{"id":"1003105","name":{"zh":"大自愈","en":"Grand Self-Healing"},"level":"1","description2":{"zh":"每回合初恢复10%生命","en":"Restores 10% HP at the start of each turn"}}],"debateSouls":[],"soulPoints":{"war":8000,"battle":7200,"debate":3800},"equipment":[{"id":"WP1006002","name":{"zh":"竹柄木枪","en":"Bamboo-Shaft Wooden Spear"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"虽是竹制兵器，但是意外的结实耐用。","en":"Though made of bamboo, it is surprisingly sturdy and durable."},"atkVal":"8","price":"7000","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1031705","name":{"zh":"敷彩将军袍","en":"Painted General's Robe"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"采用轻便的长裙与肩甲组合成的衣甲，除此之外还添加了披风，多为统领者所穿。","en":"Light armor combining a long skirt and pauldrons, plus an added cloak, typically worn by commanders."},"defenceVal":"7","hp":"700","price":"9200","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1012802","name":{"zh":"金翼钗","en":"Gold-Wing Clasp"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"带有精心雕刻的金饰，在皇亲国戚中尤为流行。","en":"Featuring intricately carved gold decorations, especially popular among the imperial family."},"mp":"970","evade":"10","price":"7000","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}},{"id":"WP1001315","name":{"zh":"乌丸马","en":"Wuwan Horse"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"来自乌丸部族的战马，其骑兵被誉为 “天下名骑” 。","en":"A warhorse from the Wuhuan tribe, whose cavalry are hailed as ‘the finest riders under heaven’."},"price":"900","slot":{"zh":"坐骑","en":"Mount"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10011","code":"0"}]},"mother":{"label":{"zh":"母亲","en":"Mother"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10183","code":"0"}]},"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10128","code":"100"},{"id":"WJ1024915","code":"100"},{"id":"WJ1025015","code":"100"},{"id":"WJ10975","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI102615","name":{"zh":"涿郡刘氏","en":"The Liu clan of Zhuo Commandery"},"years":["184","264"],"desc":{"zh":"帝尧之后，出自姬姓，汉景帝子中山靖王刘胜之后，涿郡宗室支脉。蜀汉皇族。刘备以汉室宗亲起于微末，三顾茅庐，夺荆入川，建立蜀汉，与魏吴鼎足而立，享国四十三载。","en":"Descended from Emperor Yao and originating from the Ji surname, they were a branch of the imperial clan in Zhuo Commandery tracing their lineage to Liu Sheng, Prince Jing of Zhongshan and son of Emperor Jing of Han. As the imperial house of Shu-Han, Liu Bei rose from humble origins as a scion of the Han dynasty. After making three visits to the thatched cottage, taking Jing Province, and entering Yi Province, he founded Shu-Han to stand in a tripartite balance with Wei and Wu, ruling for forty-three years."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"4","politics":"8"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[[["WJ10976","小女"],["WJ10976","小女"],["WJ10976","This humble maiden"],["WJ10976","私"],["WJ10976","소녀"]]],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"33","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios"